    {
        "content": "<p>Is there any mechanism for forcing <code>?m</code> to resolve to a bound variable rather than attempting unification?</p>",
        "id": 627812068,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1790693877
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"644391\">@loogle</span> |- Pure ?m → Option ?a → ?m ?a → ?m ?a</p>",
        "id": 627812288,
        "sender_full_name": "Joachim Breitner",
        "timestamp": 1790693922
