    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"search\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f50d\" role=\"img\" title=\"search\">:search:</span> <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Init/Data/Option/Basic.html#Option.getDM\">Option.getDM</a></p>",
        "id": 627812294,
        "sender_full_name": "loogle",
        "timestamp": 1790693924
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It seems the problem is simply that loogle gets thrown off if you write <code>[…]</code>?</p>",
        "id": 627812382,
        "sender_full_name": "Joachim Breitner",
        "timestamp": 1790693941
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Should I expect <code>∀ m, Pure m → Option ?α → m ?α → m ?α</code> to work to force m to be free?</p>",
        "id": 627812658,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1790693996
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It would be good if <code>|- (a : _) → Pure ?m → Option a → ?m a → ?m a</code> worked for this, but it doesn't</p>",
        "id": 627812674,
        "sender_full_name": "Joachim Breitner",
        "timestamp": 1790693998
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You should expect that, but you should expect to be disappointed, I fear.</p>",
